   • `i.set()` every time the store emits an update (persist).
There are no secondary locations—no background tasks, service-worker
code,
or analytics hooks—that touch `localStorage["privateKeyModulePK"]`;
every
interaction is mediated by the `subscribe` callback you have already
seen.
Bottom line: the single snippet we analysed *is* the whole lifecycle
for this
